<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Demand was light. Top $50.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 48.50-49.50, some 50.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/weak. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.  40.50-45.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs.  44.50-47.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs.  47.00-50.00</p>
<p>		few over 600 lbs.  49.00-51.00, few 52.00</p>
</text>
